      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC7311485::web::009::results_and_discussion",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An oxide film can lubricate the sliding interface and reduce friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The preformed oxide film prevents direct metal–metal contact.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The preformed oxide film suppresses surface adhesion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide film mitigates oxidative wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide-mediated self-lubricating mechanism will operate throughout 25–800 °C.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "High-temperature sliding at or above approximately 600 °C can involve adhesion, tribo-oxidation, surface softening, and severe delamination wear.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized CoCrFeNi will have significantly lower friction than untreated CoCrFeNi across 25–800 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10241162::web::003::introduction",
        "PMC9960858::web::022::4_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidized CoCrFeNi will have a lower wear rate than untreated CoCrFeNi across 25–800 °C.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
